bc43fd42 x6 T = x · (y · z) = x · (z ∘ y) & x · (((y ∘ y) · z) · w) = x
1. 15 laws of order <= 3 implied on the corpus; 15 proved by E; 7 emergent
  * x · (x · x) = x
    x · (x ∘ x) = x
  * x · (y · y) = x
    x · (y ∘ y) = x
    x · ((x ∘ x) · x) = x
    x · ((x ∘ x) · y) = x
    x · ((y ∘ y) · x) = x
    x · ((y ∘ y) · y) = x
    x · ((y ∘ y) · z) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (x ∘ x)) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (y ∘ y)) = x
  * x · (y ∘ (x ∘ x)) = x
  * x · (y ∘ (y ∘ y)) = x
  * x · (y ∘ (z ∘ z)) = x
2. shadow T + (x·y = x∘y):
   => x·y=x              True
   => x·y=y              False
   => x·x=x              True
   => x·y=y·x            False
   => (x·y)·z=x·(y·z)    True
   => x·(x·y)=y          False
   => (x·y)·y=x          True
   => x·(y·z)=x·y        True
